{
  "version": 1,
  "fps": 30,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Late one night behind the wall",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 6,
      "endFrame": 170
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Little mice held a midnight call",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 173,
      "endFrame": 347
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Said that cat's got claws and a silent tread",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 350,
      "endFrame": 521
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "One more scare and I might drop dead",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 524,
      "endFrame": 691
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Brown back grumbled ain't no peace",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 694,
      "endFrame": 857
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "I dive for crumbs and lose my fleece",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 860,
      "endFrame": 1035
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "She's a ghost with fangs and golden eyes",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1038,
      "endFrame": 1212
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "We gotta act before one more dies",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1215,
      "endFrame": 1388
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Gray ear said let's bite and run",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1391,
      "endFrame": 1556
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "A hundred squeaks and she'll be done",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1559,
      "endFrame": 1734
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "But white whisker said I've got a plan",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1737,
      "endFrame": 1911
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "We'll hang a bell on that devil if we can",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1914,
      "endFrame": 2089
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Ding a ling they all cried loud",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2092,
      "endFrame": 2251
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Freedom's ringin sang the crowd",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2254,
      "endFrame": 2430
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "We'll hear her jingle we'll dance with glee",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2433,
      "endFrame": 2602
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "She'll never again sneak up on me",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2605,
      "endFrame": 2776
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "But brown back hushed the rebel cheer",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2779,
      "endFrame": 2939
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "With a voice like truth and a touch of fear",
      "section": "section_4",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2942,
      "endFrame": 3110
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "That bell won't ring itself my friend",
      "section": "section_4",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3113,
      "endFrame": 3291
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Who's gonna tie it round her end",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3294,
      "endFrame": 3470
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "White whisker coughed well not my gig",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3473,
      "endFrame": 3635
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I got a limp and a twisted twig",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3638,
      "endFrame": 3811
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Gray ear said that ain't my track",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3814,
      "endFrame": 3990
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Since I near got snapped I don't go back",
      "section": "section_8",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3993,
      "endFrame": 4169
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "So one by one they slunk to bed",
      "section": "section_8",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4172,
      "endFrame": 4335
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "No bell was hung no word was said",
      "section": "section_8",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4338,
      "endFrame": 4512
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "You can preach and plan and talk real flat",
      "section": "section_8",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4515,
      "endFrame": 4689
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "But baby someone's gotta bell that cat",
      "section": "section_8",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4692,
      "endFrame": 4852
    }
  ],
  "density": {
    "words_per_second": 1.3,
    "density_class": "sparse",
    "avg_line_length": 7.5,
    "line_count": 28,
    "word_count": 211
  },
  "title": "Who\u2019s Gonna Bell That Cat"
}